            /** @description Tax the broker took from the account rather than from a payment, per currency, negative. A tax charged on a paper is already in its position's income; this one (in Russia, withheld on a withdrawal against the year's base) belongs to no position and is not split among them. Empty when there is none; not converted. */
            tax_withheld_by_currency: components["schemas"]["CurrencyAmount"][];
